(6854249, 1030042, 25190, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with this image good composition and lighting ..Well done nice backdrop with the glow adds too the image</td>', 'Nicely done with this image good composition and lighting ..Well done nice backdrop with the glow adds too the image', '2012-09-02 09:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6854254, 1032096, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This certainly is an image that emerges from having an unconventional eye! I like blur and I like how this image almost shudders in its execution - I also like how much we can discern - a woman, the ground, the water ahead and the buildings beyond. I like that there is story but the plot remains a mystery.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: It''s gaudy - an assault to the eye; too much probably - you risk pushing people away rather than inviting them to look and appreciate.<br/> <br/>Overall: Interesting choices - not one for me but I appreciate what you''ve done.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This certainly is an image that emerges from having an unconventional eye! I like blur and I like how this image almost shudders in its execution - I also like how much we can discern - a woman, the ground, the water ahead and the buildings beyond. I like that there is story but the plot remains a mystery. Critical stuff: It''s gaudy - an assault to the eye; too much probably - you risk pushing people away rather than inviting them to look and appreciate. Overall: Interesting choices - not one for me but I appreciate what you''ve done.', '2012-09-02 09:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6854255, 1031657, 25190, '<td valign="top">Wonderful landscape good tones and depth of field the cloud formation gives that extra POP ..Well done</td>', 'Wonderful landscape good tones and depth of field the cloud formation gives that extra POP ..Well done', '2012-09-02 09:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6854264, 1030942, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: What a superb portrait of Geoff this is and what a superb capture of a relationship too. This is a double edged sword (see critical stuff) but the technicals of Geoff''s portrait are completely stand out. The image overall is also witty and human - I really like that.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Your fill lighting on Geoff is fabulous, but Doreen is left lacking - although she''s in the background, she''s integral to your story and could perhaps do with a bit of pop. The image is highly contrived - your subjects appear too posed but... (see below)<br/> <br/>Overall: This IS a highly successful image - sure I''ve complained a little above but overall, I find I don''t care about all that - the image has such immediacy and is so forthcoming that I think it really, really works. It''s a little cliched in its poses but has bags of quirk to carry it through. An odd choice for a fav for me, but I just can''t help myself.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: What a superb portrait of Geoff this is and what a superb capture of a relationship too. This is a double edged sword (see critical stuff) but the technicals of Geoff''s portrait are completely stand out. The image overall is also witty and human - I really like that. Critical stuff: Your fill lighting on Geoff is fabulous, but Doreen is left lacking - although she''s in the background, she''s integral to your story and could perhaps do with a bit of pop. The image is highly contrived - your subjects appear too posed but... (see below) Overall: This IS a highly successful image - sure I''ve complained a little above but overall, I find I don''t care about all that - the image has such immediacy and is so forthcoming that I think it really, really works. It''s a little cliched in its poses but has bags of quirk to carry it through. An odd choice for a fav for me, but I just can''t help myself.', '2012-09-02 09:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
