(6854332, 1030214, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like this image, I particularly enjoy the transected dog! The POV is stand out and the boy''s gaze to the dog is captivating. The green coloration is excellent  - I like the way the boy''s top matches. Given the water below, I wonder where you are - on a jetty? On a boat?<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: On a wide gamut monitor with most browsers, this image is too pink - it caused me to crank up a modified (colour handling) version of Firefox and the coloration there is much better. Browser colour handling can be an issue - I thought you should know.<br/> <br/>Overall: This is a really high quality image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like this image, I particularly enjoy the transected dog! The POV is stand out and the boy''s gaze to the dog is captivating. The green coloration is excellent  - I like the way the boy''s top matches. Given the water below, I wonder where you are - on a jetty? On a boat? Critical stuff: On a wide gamut monitor with most browsers, this image is too pink - it caused me to crank up a modified (colour handling) version of Firefox and the coloration there is much better. Browser colour handling can be an issue - I thought you should know. Overall: This is a really high quality image.', '2012-09-02 11:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
