(6854705, 1031625, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the point of view looking up at this old classic car as it gets raised on the lift in the garage. I get the nice view of the front grill of the car but you have also given me the unique vantage point of looking at the underside of this car. The garage with all the vintage signs is a nice touch which complements the composition.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the point of view looking up at this old classic car as it gets raised on the lift in the garage. I get the nice view of the front grill of the car but you have also given me the unique vantage point of looking at the underside of this car. The garage with all the vintage signs is a nice touch which complements the composition.', '2012-09-02 22:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6854707, 1032069, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love how the lines of light rays and shadows complement the lines of the street and vertical lines of the beams that hold up the overpass. The lone silhouette of the person adds visual interest for he could be symbolically walking towards the light (and a brand new day).</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love how the lines of light rays and shadows complement the lines of the street and vertical lines of the beams that hold up the overpass. The lone silhouette of the person adds visual interest for he could be symbolically walking towards the light (and a brand new day).', '2012-09-02 22:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6854711, 1030214, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Even though the dog''s head has been cropped off I find this image highly appealing...and it is because of the great expressions of both boy and dog. I see the boy''s mouth as hanging down in astonishment while the dog''s mouth is happily panting away with that great big tongue hanging out. The colors, composition of elements and details are just great in this little slice of life photo.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Even though the dog''s head has been cropped off I find this image highly appealing...and it is because of the great expressions of both boy and dog. I see the boy''s mouth as hanging down in astonishment while the dog''s mouth is happily panting away with that great big tongue hanging out. The colors, composition of elements and details are just great in this little slice of life photo.', '2012-09-02 22:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
