(6854713, 1031188, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>B&amp;W tones are just fabulous! Love the rays of sunshine that burst forth from the clouds to shine on the mountain valley below. What an awesome sight this must have been to experience. Lovely work!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. B&W tones are just fabulous! Love the rays of sunshine that burst forth from the clouds to shine on the mountain valley below. What an awesome sight this must have been to experience. Lovely work!', '2012-09-02 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6854714, 1031598, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Love the juxtaposition of the two different set of wheels in this composition. One set of wheels is well cared for as seen as that the car is in the barn protected from the elements. The other set of wheels lies forgotten and rusting out in the fields as seen with the rusting bicycle. It makes me think - it could be a commentary on man''s progression with technology. the bicycle was one good method of man-made transportation until the automobile came along and now it lies mostly rusting and forgotten. The bicycle has been replaced with a quicker and more room to transport goods &amp; people method of transportation. Nice find and well composed.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Love the juxtaposition of the two different set of wheels in this composition. One set of wheels is well cared for as seen as that the car is in the barn protected from the elements. The other set of wheels lies forgotten and rusting out in the fields as seen with the rusting bicycle. It makes me think - it could be a commentary on man''s progression with technology. the bicycle was one good method of man-made transportation until the automobile came along and now it lies mostly rusting and forgotten. The bicycle has been replaced with a quicker and more room to transport goods & people method of transportation. Nice find and well composed.', '2012-09-02 22:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
