(6855242, 1030716, 91496, '<td valign="top">Moody, with beautiful tones, and... telephone poles!  Clone those puppies out and make this one shine.</td>', 'Moody, with beautiful tones, and... telephone poles!  Clone those puppies out and make this one shine.', '2012-09-03 11:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855254, 1031021, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great patterns and tones.  I like the little wisps of clouds.  The border is really odd here and detracts from the image big time.</td>', 'Great patterns and tones.  I like the little wisps of clouds.  The border is really odd here and detracts from the image big time.', '2012-09-03 11:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855261, 1030974, 91496, '<td valign="top">I really like the textures and tonality here.  The white areas work well except the lower right where it looks to fake to me.</td>', 'I really like the textures and tonality here.  The white areas work well except the lower right where it looks to fake to me.', '2012-09-03 11:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855283, 1030942, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of the two of them.  I like the angles that you used and the DOF where both are in focus.  I found the objects they are holding/wearing to be a bit of a distraction and to confuse the "story" of these folks.</td>', 'Nice portrait of the two of them.  I like the angles that you used and the DOF where both are in focus.  I found the objects they are holding/wearing to be a bit of a distraction and to confuse the "story" of these folks.', '2012-09-03 12:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855285, 1029196, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great expression.  I like the lights/grill on either side.  Border does not work fro me and draws my ee away from you subject.  Use the KISS prionciple on borders.</td>', 'Great expression.  I like the lights/grill on either side.  Border does not work fro me and draws my ee away from you subject.  Use the KISS prionciple on borders.', '2012-09-03 12:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855287, 1030747, 91496, '<td valign="top">I give you kudso for a brave compositional choice.  THe bird works for me on some level , but the wire is not interesting and really draws my eye to it.</td>', 'I give you kudso for a brave compositional choice.  THe bird works for me on some level , but the wire is not interesting and really draws my eye to it.', '2012-09-03 12:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855290, 1031308, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great tones and nice leading lines.  The odd border draws my eye away from the photo since it is the only dark area in the whole image.  A simple thin square may have complimented the photo better.</td>', 'Great tones and nice leading lines.  The odd border draws my eye away from the photo since it is the only dark area in the whole image.  A simple thin square may have complimented the photo better.', '2012-09-03 12:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855292, 1032053, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like all the black and grey tonese here.  Very odd compositional choice.  His head is replacing hers and only two arms are visable for two people.</td>', 'I like all the black and grey tonese here.  Very odd compositional choice.  His head is replacing hers and only two arms are visable for two people.', '2012-09-03 12:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855295, 1030236, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  May have a little two many levels of interest.  I wonder if the top half would not be a more simple and interesting composition.</td>', 'Great capture.  May have a little two many levels of interest.  I wonder if the top half would not be a more simple and interesting composition.', '2012-09-03 12:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855298, 1031049, 91496, '<td valign="top">I really like the echo of the big and little stumps.  Perhaps getting lower and/or closer with a wide angle lens could have empasized this even more.  THe horizon may be a little tilted.</td>', 'I really like the echo of the big and little stumps.  Perhaps getting lower and/or closer with a wide angle lens could have empasized this even more.  THe horizon may be a little tilted.', '2012-09-03 12:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855300, 1029879, 91496, '<td valign="top">I love this composition.  Nice colors.  Two thing to try if you did on this effort.  1,  Focus on  butterfly with the flower OOF or a higher DOF and get both in focus.</td>', 'I love this composition.  Nice colors.  Two thing to try if you did on this effort.  1,  Focus on  butterfly with the flower OOF or a higher DOF and get both in focus.', '2012-09-03 12:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855301, 1031489, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>What lovely detail in this seahorse! Love how he is curled around the seagrass and seems to be peeking out to see if it is safe. Lighting and color are well captured.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. What lovely detail in this seahorse! Love how he is curled around the seagrass and seems to be peeking out to see if it is safe. Lighting and color are well captured.', '2012-09-03 12:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
