(6855319, 1032029, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wow -- that is some use of negative space.  It works well but might be too mcuh.  I think a square crop might work great here.  It is not DPC legal but try using the clone tool to move the boat it to the lower right so it is driving into the frame rather than out of it.</td>', 'Wow -- that is some use of negative space.  It works well but might be too mcuh.  I think a square crop might work great here.  It is not DPC legal but try using the clone tool to move the boat it to the lower right so it is driving into the frame rather than out of it.', '2012-09-03 13:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
