(6855608, 1031293, 149281, '<td valign="top">Love this, While my dad and I were on Sanibel Island surf fishing one of these came down and grabbed his stringer with a couple of fish on it. We had ten foot leaders on our stringers, he was cussing and trying to swat at it with his pole and it was just out of reach. One of the funniest and fondest memories with my father. 10</td>', 'Love this, While my dad and I were on Sanibel Island surf fishing one of these came down and grabbed his stringer with a couple of fish on it. We had ten foot leaders on our stringers, he was cussing and trying to swat at it with his pole and it was just out of reach. One of the funniest and fondest memories with my father. 10', '2012-09-03 19:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855612, 1031810, 149281, '<td valign="top">Incredible color. Nice shot</td>', 'Incredible color. Nice shot', '2012-09-03 19:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855613, 1031907, 149281, '<td valign="top">I have these same butterfly bushes in my yard, they smell amazing. Focus seems soft.</td>', 'I have these same butterfly bushes in my yard, they smell amazing. Focus seems soft.', '2012-09-03 19:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855614, 1031650, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is a delightful and slightly poignant image. I like how the colour and light bleeds away at the edges of the frame like a metaphor of her life. I really like the resigned manner in which her bag is placed; like it''s taking a rest - again, this reflects the overall mood of someone caught up in a reflective moment.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Some will find the vignette a little strong.<br/> <br/>Overall: Beautifully observed and processed in alignment with the sentiment of the image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is a delightful and slightly poignant image. I like how the colour and light bleeds away at the edges of the frame like a metaphor of her life. I really like the resigned manner in which her bag is placed; like it''s taking a rest - again, this reflects the overall mood of someone caught up in a reflective moment. Critical stuff: Some will find the vignette a little strong. Overall: Beautifully observed and processed in alignment with the sentiment of the image.', '2012-09-03 19:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
