(6856102, 1031903, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is not mere dog. Is fearsome predator and defender of tribe of Grog. Dog stands guard over females and younglings when Grog and other males away on hunt. Youngest female child of Grog give name "Cuddles" to viscous dog. (Grog lets male youngling name animals from now on.)</td>', 'Is not mere dog. Is fearsome predator and defender of tribe of Grog. Dog stands guard over females and younglings when Grog and other males away on hunt. Youngest female child of Grog give name "Cuddles" to viscous dog. (Grog lets male youngling name animals from now on.)', '2012-09-04 14:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6856103, 1029759, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love the tongue.</td>', 'Love the tongue.', '2012-09-04 14:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6856104, 1030130, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the eye contact.  Background is a little noisy but I know I''ve had to ratchet up the ISO to get one in focus, too.  Always fascinating to have a Hummer pause and look at me like this. Still haven''t managed to successfully pass inspection, I don''t think!</td>', 'Love the eye contact.  Background is a little noisy but I know I''ve had to ratchet up the ISO to get one in focus, too.  Always fascinating to have a Hummer pause and look at me like this. Still haven''t managed to successfully pass inspection, I don''t think!', '2012-09-04 14:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
