(6856357, 1029673, 51747, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. Nice in B&amp;W too. If I were to guess the ID on this Hawk I would say that it''s a juvenile Red Tail. The dark mottling in the breast feathers are a RT characteristic. Cooper''s would have thinner lines from top to bottom. The light eye color would suggest that this bird is in it''s first or second year.</td>', 'Awesome capture. Nice in B&W too. If I were to guess the ID on this Hawk I would say that it''s a juvenile Red Tail. The dark mottling in the breast feathers are a RT characteristic. Cooper''s would have thinner lines from top to bottom. The light eye color would suggest that this bird is in it''s first or second year.', '2012-09-04 22:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
