(6856988, 1031303, 108982, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but it leaves me with a sense of something missing.  Then after coming back to it repeatedly I realize that I have never seen a street musician without his instrument case open in front of him and some sort of cash collection device such as his hat, a cup, a fishbowl something.  When i imaging those things in this picture it completes the composition in mind.  That being said it still a 6</td>', 'I like this photo but it leaves me with a sense of something missing.  Then after coming back to it repeatedly I realize that I have never seen a street musician without his instrument case open in front of him and some sort of cash collection device such as his hat, a cup, a fishbowl something.  When i imaging those things in this picture it completes the composition in mind.  That being said it still a 6', '2012-09-05 14:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6856989, 1031904, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1<br/>Who is he? <br/>Why the long sleeve shirt with the coat on his head during the summer? (Assuming Northern Hemisphere) The beard adds dimensions to his look. The only thing I don''t like is the overexposed watch face, my eyes wonder there a little too much, but this image still felt more real compared to the other entries.</td>', '#1Who is he? Why the long sleeve shirt with the coat on his head during the summer? (Assuming Northern Hemisphere) The beard adds dimensions to his look. The only thing I don''t like is the overexposed watch face, my eyes wonder there a little too much, but this image still felt more real compared to the other entries.', '2012-09-05 14:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6856991, 1031850, 83313, '<td valign="top">Actually, it''s a bison, which is only a distant relative to the buffalo. Handsome animals, along with longhorn steers.</td>', 'Actually, it''s a bison, which is only a distant relative to the buffalo. Handsome animals, along with longhorn steers.', '2012-09-05 14:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
