(6857575, 1030772, 12611, '<td valign="top">I am assuming this is Paul, given its the same girl from a few challenges ago. ONe thing that is nice here is that you set the mood, the boundaries of the space, the wood floor, the red pillows very well. Not in a compositional way, but in a spacial way, is that makes sense at all. <br/> <br/>And the light, its soft and wonderful, it covers her like a second skin.</td>', 'I am assuming this is Paul, given its the same girl from a few challenges ago. ONe thing that is nice here is that you set the mood, the boundaries of the space, the wood floor, the red pillows very well. Not in a compositional way, but in a spacial way, is that makes sense at all.  And the light, its soft and wonderful, it covers her like a second skin.', '2012-09-05 23:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
