(6858985, 1031988, 108580, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus on the eye and adorable splayed crown feathers. Good BG and comp. OE by at least a 1/3rd of a stop. The feathers are a bit washed out.</td>', 'Excellent focus on the eye and adorable splayed crown feathers. Good BG and comp. OE by at least a 1/3rd of a stop. The feathers are a bit washed out.', '2012-09-07 04:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858987, 1030130, 108580, '<td valign="top">Good shot of the hummer, with steady head yet beating blurred wings, but a bit dark offset by a lighter BG that may have affected your exposure. Wing tip is also cut off.</td>', 'Good shot of the hummer, with steady head yet beating blurred wings, but a bit dark offset by a lighter BG that may have affected your exposure. Wing tip is also cut off.', '2012-09-07 04:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858991, 1032033, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great in the wild shot of the (Grey?) Heron with lunch. Nice timing. Good s/s to get the head relatively steady yet blur on the wings. Pity it is quartering away from you slightly and the head/eye appears unsharp.</td>', 'Great in the wild shot of the (Grey?) Heron with lunch. Nice timing. Good s/s to get the head relatively steady yet blur on the wings. Pity it is quartering away from you slightly and the head/eye appears unsharp.', '2012-09-07 04:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858992, 1031692, 108580, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2012-09-07 04:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858994, 1032085, 108580, '<td valign="top">Very nice floral image and conversion. 7.</td>', 'Very nice floral image and conversion. 7.', '2012-09-07 04:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858996, 1029673, 108580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird and perfect BG to offset it. Bird sanctuary shot which doesn''t lesen the image quality, just the difficulty to get it. Good composition and obligatory catchlight in the eye. I''m in two minds about the B&amp;W conversion as these raptors are very colourful.  The shade on the neck is annoying and unfortunate.</td>', 'Beautiful bird and perfect BG to offset it. Bird sanctuary shot which doesn''t lesen the image quality, just the difficulty to get it. Good composition and obligatory catchlight in the eye. I''m in two minds about the B&W conversion as these raptors are very colourful.  The shade on the neck is annoying and unfortunate.', '2012-09-07 04:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858997, 1031247, 108580, '<td valign="top">Happy shot and you chose perfect location (spot) to take it with uniform BG. Good clarity and focus and not too harsh despite the direct sunlight. Steve?</td>', 'Happy shot and you chose perfect location (spot) to take it with uniform BG. Good clarity and focus and not too harsh despite the direct sunlight. Steve?', '2012-09-07 04:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858998, 1032044, 131419, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2012-09-07 04:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858999, 1031962, 131419, '<td valign="top">So Beautiful,</td>', 'So Beautiful,', '2012-09-07 04:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6859000, 1031293, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely stop motion image of the Osprey. I especially like the claws and feet extended and intent on it''s face. Good exposure despite the annoying bright white top right which constantly attracts my eyes away.</td>', 'Lovely stop motion image of the Osprey. I especially like the claws and feet extended and intent on it''s face. Good exposure despite the annoying bright white top right which constantly attracts my eyes away.', '2012-09-07 04:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6859002, 1030732, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely compo. Great DOF. Crisp and clear on the bird but due overcast condition a lack of (these days) an expected catchlight in the eye. Pity the tail feathers are chopped off in frame.</td>', 'Lovely compo. Great DOF. Crisp and clear on the bird but due overcast condition a lack of (these days) an expected catchlight in the eye. Pity the tail feathers are chopped off in frame.', '2012-09-07 04:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6859003, 1030032, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely image of the hummer, with correct s/s to get the head still but a blur on the wings. Obligatory catchlight and a BG to die for. A bit dull on the body and a flash with snoot or reflector might have improved that.</td>', 'Lovely image of the hummer, with correct s/s to get the head still but a blur on the wings. Obligatory catchlight and a BG to die for. A bit dull on the body and a flash with snoot or reflector might have improved that.', '2012-09-07 04:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6859004, 1031710, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely interaction shot. The child is inquisitive but non-committal :) The Pelican is wary but non-plussed. Great seaside candid.<br/></td>', 'Lovely interaction shot. The child is inquisitive but non-committal :) The Pelican is wary but non-plussed. Great seaside candid.', '2012-09-07 04:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6859007, 1031566, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great technique and excellent focus on the eye (beyond the beak which is hard to do) and cute inquisitive typical bird like pose. Your BG is to die for, green and smooth. Your exposure is spot on, if perhaps lacking a little extra contrast which you could add in PP. Whilst this is clearly a Nature shot (bird attracted to a feeding station) and not a true Wildlife (in the Wild) shot you have displayed promise and skill in most of the departments needed in good thoughtful bird photography. It would be good at the next attempt to also take note of the tail feathers and get them in the shot seeing as the bird is relatively stationary and your chances to capture are numerous in the space of a few minutes :P Despite the easy location and the cropped tail I''m giving this a Free Study 7. Well Done.</td>', 'Great technique and excellent focus on the eye (beyond the beak which is hard to do) and cute inquisitive typical bird like pose. Your BG is to die for, green and smooth. Your exposure is spot on, if perhaps lacking a little extra contrast which you could add in PP. Whilst this is clearly a Nature shot (bird attracted to a feeding station) and not a true Wildlife (in the Wild) shot you have displayed promise and skill in most of the departments needed in good thoughtful bird photography. It would be good at the next attempt to also take note of the tail feathers and get them in the shot seeing as the bird is relatively stationary and your chances to capture are numerous in the space of a few minutes :P Despite the easy location and the cropped tail I''m giving this a Free Study 7. Well Done.', '2012-09-07 04:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6859008, 1031989, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice action and great splash and drops in the sunlight. Pity about the cropped wing tip at top and you are unfortunately on the dark side of the bird, photographing it in it''s own shadow.</td>', 'Nice action and great splash and drops in the sunlight. Pity about the cropped wing tip at top and you are unfortunately on the dark side of the bird, photographing it in it''s own shadow.', '2012-09-07 04:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6859009, 1030610, 108580, '<td valign="top">Technically challenging image to obtain. Not withstanding the photographic ability, large aperture, fast shutter speed, perfectly stationary long lens/body but also to get TO the sighting, setup and shoot without the bird flying off is incredibly difficult to achieve. The flying debris is also magnificent as is the head caught stationary mid strike even though it''s pecking at 50 ppm :) POV and composition spot on. Only niggle I can give is a missing eye catchlight, but for me this is a minor imperfection. Bird behaviour photography at it''s best. 10.</td>', 'Technically challenging image to obtain. Not withstanding the photographic ability, large aperture, fast shutter speed, perfectly stationary long lens/body but also to get TO the sighting, setup and shoot without the bird flying off is incredibly difficult to achieve. The flying debris is also magnificent as is the head caught stationary mid strike even though it''s pecking at 50 ppm :) POV and composition spot on. Only niggle I can give is a missing eye catchlight, but for me this is a minor imperfection. Bird behaviour photography at it''s best. 10.', '2012-09-07 04:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6859033, 1032100, 131419, '<td valign="top">Classic</td>', 'Classic', '2012-09-07 05:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
