(6859156, 1029938, 138630, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually an orange fan but here I find the color rich and warm.  This is a beautiful staircase and it makes a terrific abstract.  Love the simple, sweeping lines.  10  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I''m not usually an orange fan but here I find the color rich and warm.  This is a beautiful staircase and it makes a terrific abstract.  Love the simple, sweeping lines.  10  Voted earlier.', '2012-09-07 11:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6859157, 1030579, 138630, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this - the background tones are very unusual but richly beautiful and the white of the gull poised for flight against the darker, muted tones is startling.  I might have cropped the right post off, but that''s your call of course.  10 from me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this - the background tones are very unusual but richly beautiful and the white of the gull poised for flight against the darker, muted tones is startling.  I might have cropped the right post off, but that''s your call of course.  10 from me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-09-07 11:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
