(6859405, 1029641, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice feather details and decent smooth BG to 3D the bird. Nice moment caught in full cry. Not fond of the processing, it almost looks too smooth overall. The eye appears sharp and so does the ridge line of wing feathers but the white neck feathers are OOF with very little detail, not physically possible so sone sharpening has been applied.</td>', 'Nice feather details and decent smooth BG to 3D the bird. Nice moment caught in full cry. Not fond of the processing, it almost looks too smooth overall. The eye appears sharp and so does the ridge line of wing feathers but the white neck feathers are OOF with very little detail, not physically possible so sone sharpening has been applied.', '2012-09-07 15:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6859479, 1032054, 108580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful POV with crisp yet extremely shallow focus on the eye, obligatory catchlight, BG to die for and a lovely composition if a tiny bit tight on the left. Well done on a technically superb bird image.</td>', 'Beautiful POV with crisp yet extremely shallow focus on the eye, obligatory catchlight, BG to die for and a lovely composition if a tiny bit tight on the left. Well done on a technically superb bird image.', '2012-09-07 17:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
