(6859873, 1030018, 69008, '<td valign="top">Looks like a ''28.   Thanks for the memory jog.  I had a ''30 model "AA"  1-ton truck when I was in high school. It was probably the best, or at the time, the most fun vehicle that I have ever driven.  It had the same cab, with a 4 speed transmission and dual truck tires on the back.</td>', 'Looks like a ''28.   Thanks for the memory jog.  I had a ''30 model "AA"  1-ton truck when I was in high school. It was probably the best, or at the time, the most fun vehicle that I have ever driven.  It had the same cab, with a 4 speed transmission and dual truck tires on the back.', '2012-09-08 03:50:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6859874, 1032017, 108580, '<td valign="top">Gun safety is rather critical in my world :) Been carrying for 30+ years. Sorry if I seemed harsh, it''s only a photo after all. In SA we are only allowed 0.177" unlicensed. 0.22" has to be licensed. A break neck .22! Interesting. Grog''s right, those nails! :)</td>', 'Gun safety is rather critical in my world :) Been carrying for 30+ years. Sorry if I seemed harsh, it''s only a photo after all. In SA we are only allowed 0.177" unlicensed. 0.22" has to be licensed. A break neck .22! Interesting. Grog''s right, those nails! :)', '2012-09-08 04:01:59.000000', NULL, 0),
