(6860376, 1031448, 67697, '<td valign="top">You know, I loved the clarity on the face but I too wanted to see a perspective from the front.  I don''t think this deserves a score that low tho lol.  Crazy stuff.</td>', 'You know, I loved the clarity on the face but I too wanted to see a perspective from the front.  I don''t think this deserves a score that low tho lol.  Crazy stuff.', '2012-09-08 23:28:47.000000', NULL, 0),
