(6861621, 1032068, 65319, '<td valign="top">James, upon opening your image, I''m immediately struck by the fabulous and beautiful location where these horses are so peacefully grazing in such soft lovely light on the BEACH!!!  Obviously, these ponies appear quite at home and remind me of the Icelandic ponies in shape and form.  Inquiring minds want to know more so I googled this location.  How very fortunate you are to have access to <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assateague_Island" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this island</a>!  I''m jealous!  ;-)</td>', 'James, upon opening your image, I''m immediately struck by the fabulous and beautiful location where these horses are so peacefully grazing in such soft lovely light on the BEACH!!!  Obviously, these ponies appear quite at home and remind me of the Icelandic ponies in shape and form.  Inquiring minds want to know more so I googled this location.  How very fortunate you are to have access to this island!  I''m jealous!  ;-)', '2012-09-11 11:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
