(6861763, 1031416, 10785, '<td valign="top">Spiff!! I am starting to like your portrait style that you have been showing us. The bicycle theme is great stuff! One thing I am noticing is you are going to have to invest in a nice low light lens... your shutter speeds are dragging way too low and showing a lot of motion in the subject. Unless that is what you are going for...</td>', 'Spiff!! I am starting to like your portrait style that you have been showing us. The bicycle theme is great stuff! One thing I am noticing is you are going to have to invest in a nice low light lens... your shutter speeds are dragging way too low and showing a lot of motion in the subject. Unless that is what you are going for...', '2012-09-11 17:20:29.000000', NULL, 0),
